From: PortalWrt R3 Mini maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] mediatek: separate HNAT PPE recirculation from PHY carrier

The opt-in internal netdev owns a shared-DMA reference and its own BQL/qdisc
identity. Physical GMACs retain phylink carrier and PHY rate matching.

